Restore mrDB Deployment
A mrDB Deployment in the mrdb namespace has been deleted by mistake. Your task is to restore the Deployment while ensuring data persistence.
Tasks
Create a PersistentVolumeClaim (PVC)
Name: mrdb
Namespace: mrdb
Storage Request: 250Mi
Use the existing retained PersistentVolume (only one PV exists).
Modify the mrDB Deployment
The Deployment file is located at:

~/mrdb-deployment.yaml

Update the Deployment to use the PVC mrdb created in the previous step.

Apply the updated Deployment to the cluster.
Validation
Ensure the following:

mrDB Pod is running
PVC is bound to the retained PersistentVolume
